{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29181","headline":"和常秀才寄简归州郑使君借猨 · 许浑","name":"和常秀才寄简归州郑使君借猨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢守携猨东路长，褭藤穿竹似潇湘。\n碧山初鸣啸秋月，红树生寒啼晓霜。\n陌上楚人皆驻马，里中巴客半归乡。\n心知欲借南游侣，未到三声恐断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}